---
title: "Runway loop"
note: "An endless show: every clip, the last model turns and walks back in her look ($look[-1]) while the next one comes in wearing a new one ($look). Chain it with Orrery Continue and Orrery Film, then Run (Instant); rate the looks in the gallery and the show learns your taste."
tags: [fashion, h3, reel, motion_context]
---
@h3 text 9:16
style: live-action, cinematic fashion film
context: 22
$house = __couture_house__
$venue = __couture_venue__

MUSIC: a heavy techno pulse at a slow tempo with a distorted kick drum

SCENE the opening
$model = __couture_model__
$look = __couture_form__ in __couture_material__
SHOT 6s: tracking, slow
The $house show at $venue opens: $model walks down the runway toward the camera wearing $look, a {2$$__couture_adjective__} look. Camera flashes burst from both sides while the front row watches in silence.
SFX: sharp heel strikes on a hard floor; a rapid ripple of camera shutters
END ON: the model reaches the end of the runway and pauses

SCENE the rotation forever
$model = __couture_model__
$look = __couture_form__ in __couture_material__
SHOT 6s: static
At the end of the runway, $model[-1] turns and walks back in $look[-1], while $model walks toward the camera wearing $look, a {2$$__couture_adjective__} look, and the two pass each other without a glance.
SFX: two sets of heel strikes cross on the hard floor; camera shutters ripple
END ON: the new model reaches the end of the runway and pauses
